n Hürzeler","Arsenal","Manchester City","Pascal Groß"],"url":"https://actusport24h.fr/article/premier-league-26-buts-personne-au-dessus-de-quatre-realisations-comme/"},{"slug":"mercato-psg-nico-paz-priorite-offensive-de-luis-enrique-mais-la-concur","title":"Mercato PSG : Nico Paz, priorité offensive de Luis Enrique, mais la concurrence est rude","hook":"Selon le média espagnol Fichajes, le Paris Saint-Germain a fait du milieu offensif argentin de Côme Nico Paz une priorité pour l'été prochain. Chelsea, Arsenal, Manchester United et le Real Madrid sont aussi sur le coup.","date":"2026-11-13T12:25:08.195Z","updated":"2026-11-13T14:14:45.300Z","section":"psg","sections":["psg","mercato"],"sectionName":"PSG","color":"#1B3A8C","sport":null,"label":"rumeur","labelName":"Rumeur","image":"https://actusport24h.fr/img/posts/paz.jpg","thumb":"https://actusport24h.fr/img/thumbs/paz.webp","imageAlt":"Nico Paz sous le maillot de Côme","credit":"© Icon Sport / Foot01","read":2,"tags":["PSG","Mercato","Nico Paz","Côme","Real Madrid","Luis Enrique","Luis Campos"],"url":"https://actusport24h.fr/article/mercato-psg-nico-paz-priorite-offensive-de-luis-enrique-mais-la-concur/"},{"slug":"mercato-psg-paris-s-interesse-a-maxim-de-cuyper-le-lateral-gauche-de-b","title":"Mercato PSG : Paris s'intéresse à Maxim De Cuyper, le latéral gauche de Brighton estimé à 60 M€","hook":"Selon le média belge Voetbalnieuws, le Paris Saint-Germain étudie le profil de Maxim De Cuyper pour renforcer son couloir gauche. Brighton en demanderait environ 60 millions d'euros.","date":"2026-11-13T11:58:29.439Z","updated":"2026-11-13T12:22:41.000Z","section":"psg","sections":["psg","mercato"],"sectionName":"PSG","color":"#1B3A8C","sport":null,"label":"rumeur","labelName":"Rumeur","image":"https://actusport24h.fr/img/posts/decuyper.jpg","thumb":"https://actusport24h.fr/img/thumbs/decuyper.webp","imageAlt":"Maxim De Cuyper sous le maillot de Brighton","credit":"© Icon Sport / Foot01","read":2,"tags":["PSG","Mercato","